WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.740
Now an event people watch

2
00:00:01.740 --> 00:00:04.102
from wherever they are.

3
00:00:04.102 --> 00:00:06.695
From your brand's home, tap plus,

4
00:00:06.695 --> 00:00:07.963
Create event,

5
00:00:07.963 --> 00:00:09.735
then Ticketed event.

6
00:00:12.913 --> 00:00:15.990
Name it, and set the format to Online.

7
00:00:16.716 --> 00:00:18.124
Pick a party type,

8
00:00:18.124 --> 00:00:20.328
then the vibe tags and the genres

9
00:00:20.328 --> 00:00:21.538
the set will cover.

10
00:00:21.868 --> 00:00:23.568
They all show up as tags

11
00:00:23.568 --> 00:00:24.962
on your event page.

12
00:00:25.676 --> 00:00:27.546
Then say what the stream is,

13
00:00:27.546 --> 00:00:29.435
and what guests get from it.

14
00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:41.263
Step two:

15
00:00:41.533 --> 00:00:42.666
pick the date,

16
00:00:42.666 --> 00:00:44.172
when the stream starts,

17
00:00:44.172 --> 00:00:45.454
and when it ends.

18
00:01:02.780 --> 00:01:04.142
Because it's online,

19
00:01:04.142 --> 00:01:07.101
step three is a link, not an address.

20
00:01:07.322 --> 00:01:09.342
Only ticket holders get it.

21
00:01:10.280 --> 00:01:12.640
Step four is how it looks.

22
00:01:12.856 --> 00:01:14.595
Add a video cover

23
00:01:14.724 --> 00:01:16.432
we've sped up the upload.

24
00:01:17.038 --> 00:01:18.221
Under the cover,

25
00:01:18.221 --> 00:01:20.617
add more photos, up to eight.

26
00:01:20.872 --> 00:01:23.896
Guests swipe through them after the video.

27
00:01:24.519 --> 00:01:25.748
Then the theme:

28
00:01:25.878 --> 00:01:27.846
a colour, a typeface,

29
00:01:27.846 --> 00:01:29.243
and a little motion.

30
00:01:29.484 --> 00:01:32.102
The preview changes as you choose.

31
00:01:57.413 --> 00:01:59.722
Step five: tickets.

32
00:01:59.988 --> 00:02:02.373
Name the pass, describe it,

33
00:02:02.379 --> 00:02:03.937
and set the price.

34
00:02:04.265 --> 00:02:06.388
A stream has no room to fill,

35
00:02:06.388 --> 00:02:09.135
so turn on unlimited capacity.

36
00:02:09.788 --> 00:02:11.553
Under Available at,

37
00:02:11.553 --> 00:02:13.906
choose Online only.

38
00:02:14.472 --> 00:02:17.196
Set how many one person can buy,

39
00:02:17.289 --> 00:02:18.809
allow transfers,

40
00:02:18.809 --> 00:02:20.128
and save.

41
00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:33.266
In settings, keep it public.

42
00:02:33.394 --> 00:02:36.280
A private guest list hides who's going,

43
00:02:36.287 --> 00:02:37.938
but still shows how many.

44
00:02:40.480 --> 00:02:42.484
Step seven shows the event

45
00:02:42.484 --> 00:02:44.472
the way guests will see it.

46
00:02:44.920 --> 00:02:48.158
Publish, and sales open straight away.

47
00:02:52.080 --> 00:02:54.339
And it's live, with the cover,

48
00:02:54.339 --> 00:02:55.945
an Online tag,

49
00:02:55.959 --> 00:02:58.911
and your photos right under the title.

50
00:02:59.587 --> 00:03:01.508
Every customer Mingla drives

51
00:03:01.508 --> 00:03:03.788
your way lands right here.
